# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate for the latest version of Qiskit noise learning"
msgstr "Aprende el modelo de ruido de una puerta en la última versión de Qiskit noise learning"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate"
msgstr "Aprende el modelo de ruido de una puerta"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"
msgstr "Aprende el modelo de ruido de una puerta {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates learning a noise model for a unitary gate with a standard learning protocol accessible through the high-level protocol functions [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") and [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Este tutorial muestra cómo aprender un modelo de ruido para una puerta unitaria con un protocolo de aprendizaje estándar accesible mediante las funciones de protocolo de alto nivel [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") y [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the gate\n"
msgstr "Definir la puerta\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up local simulation\n"
msgstr "Configurar la simulación local\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Preparar el programa cuántico\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Ejecutar el programa cuántico\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the results\n"
msgstr "Leer los resultados\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Running on real hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The circuits below are simulated locally, so this walkthrough needs no IBM Quantum® credentials. To alternatively run it on a real device:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Ejecución en hardware real\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Los circuitos siguientes se simulan localmente, por lo que este recorrido no necesita credenciales de IBM Quantum®. Para ejecutarlo en un dispositivo real:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '  *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: replace [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") with a real backend.\n"
msgstr "**Paso 1**: reemplaza [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") por un backend real.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *   **Step 2**: pass that backend as the executor’s mode, and drop the simulator options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  *   **Paso 2**: pasa ese backend como modo del executor y elimina las opciones del simulador.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"define-the-gate\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define the gate {#1-define-the-gate}"
msgstr "1. Definir la puerta {#1-define-the-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gate is a [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) holding a twirled layer of six disjoint `CZ` gates.\n"
msgstr "La puerta es un [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) que contiene una capa con twirling de seis puertas `CZ` disjuntas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Running on real hardware\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Ejecución en hardware real\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"set-up-local-simulation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Set up local simulation {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"
msgstr "2. Configurar la simulación local {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli indices inside each map are local to the gate, in ascending physical-qubit order:\n"
msgstr "Los índices de Pauli dentro de cada mapa son locales a la puerta, en orden ascendente de qubit físico:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the noise with a correlated `ZZ` term and a weaker `XX` term on each `CZ` pair, plus a single-qubit `Z` term everywhere; measurement gets a bit-flip term per qubit.\n"
msgstr "Define el ruido con un término `ZZ` correlacionado y un término `XX` más débil en cada par `CZ`, además de un término `Z` de un solo qubit en todas partes; la medición recibe un término de inversión de bit por qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a box for measurement to learn.\n"
msgstr "Construye una caja para que la medición aprenda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each entry of `layer_noise_model` pairs one of those boxes with the map to apply to it. Use the stabilizer simulation method, and set `seed_simulator` to make the simulated data reproducible.\n"
msgstr "Cada entrada de `layer_noise_model` empareja una de esas cajas con el mapa que se le aplica. Usa el método de simulación de estabilizadores y establece `seed_simulator` para que los datos simulados sean reproducibles.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"prepare-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Prepare the quantum program {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "3. Prepara el programa cuántico {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") to build the quantum program containing the learning experiments.\n"
msgstr "Usa [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") para construir el programa cuántico que contiene los experimentos de aprendizaje.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Run the quantum program {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "4. Ejecuta el programa cuántico {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the quantum program. This step is the same whether the executor is pointed at a simulator or at a real device.\n"
msgstr "Envía el programa cuántico. Este paso es el mismo tanto si el ejecutor apunta a un simulador como a un dispositivo real.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"read-the-results\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Read the results {#5-read-the-results}"
msgstr "5. Lee los resultados {#5-read-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Process the result with [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Procesa el resultado con [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot per-qubit-pair fidelity decays: both the data and the exponential fit.\n"
msgstr "Grafica los decaimientos de fidelidad por par de qubits: tanto los datos como el ajuste exponencial.\n"
